  "corrections_and_failed_attempts": [
    "Original heartbeat builders have no useful return length; use strlen(output)+1, not their return register.",
    "IJL channel outgoing buffer is 0x10000, HJL 0x20000; counter and heartbeat fields move with it. Initial shared-layout attempt produced a wrong IJL sequence.",
    "New host glibc initially introduced unavailable symbol versions; harness pins GLIBC_2.17 startup/dlopen symbols and uses original guest libdl/loader with --allow-shlib-undefined.",
    "Host strtoul redirected to GLIBC_2.38; fixed by accepting only the two explicit capacity strings.",
    "Native unused header padding can contain memory bytes; publish zero padding only, original decoder accepted canonical frames.",
    "CLI originally treated HeartbeatTimeout as normal EOF; corrected and regression-tested for error exit 2.",
    "Required scan numeric fields originally skipped None in the builder; corrected to reject null and regression-tested before network use.",
    "A new regression test initially imported validate_action from the top-level module; corrected to its documented application submodule.",
    "Isolated pip --target used bin/mesh37591.exe on this host, rather than Scripts/mesh37591.exe; actual generated launcher was located and tested.",
    "Live ordinary controller request used an empty record URL. Version0.1.0 rejected it;0.1.1 preserves empty raw record metadata while connection/login identities remain strict. Attempt1 lacked raw bytes; attempt3 captured the empty field; attempt4 sustained45seconds."
  ],
